#: manual/how-it-works.md:1
msgid "How it works"
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:3
msgid "The game already builds a greeting-free dialog for its phone-book quick dial. Quick Call uses that dialog for every call and removes the timers around it."
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:5
msgid "Dialing"
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:7
msgid "`PhoneUIManager.PressNumber` waits 2.25 s after each digit for more digits. Once the typed digits form a whole contact number that will answer, and no longer number starts with them, the mod places the call right away, the way the phone book's quick dial does."
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:9
msgid "Ringing and pickup"
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:11
msgid "`StartCalling` rolls 1 to 5 s of ringing and `StartPhoneDialogSequence` waits 1.5 s for the pickup. The mod sets both timers to almost nothing. Numbers that don't answer still go through the normal flow, so \"no answer\" appears at once."
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:13
msgid "Greeting lines"
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:15
msgid "Each contact's dialog builder checks `isQuickDialCall` and, when it is set, returns the line with the choices instead of the greeting. For Wild that is `wild2` instead of `wild1` followed by `wild2`. The mod sets the flag around every call. Intro, cooldown and story dialogs have no quick variant, so they play in full."
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:17
msgid "Choices"
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:19
msgid "The first line is shown whole instead of typed out, and the choices appear as soon as it is shown, instead of 0.85 s later."
msgstr ""

#: manual/how-it-works.md:21
msgid "The mod patches only `PhoneUIManager` and `DialoguePhoneUIManager`."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "Quick Call"
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "Calling Wild or your suppliers? This mod skips the wait and gets straight to business: calls open on their choices."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "![Quick Call cover](../attachments/cover.png)"
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "What it removes"
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "The 2.25 s wait after the last digit. A contact's number dials as soon as you finish typing it."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:10
msgid "The 1 to 5 s of ringing and the 1.5 s pickup pause. A number that doesn't answer says so at once."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "The greeting lines. Every call opens on the line with the choices."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:12
msgid "The pause before the choices appear. The first line shows in full and the choices appear with it."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:14
msgid "What stays"
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "Intro calls, cooldown replies and story calls play in full."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "Everything after you pick a choice works as before."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:18
msgid "The phone book's quick dial works as before, now without the pause before the choices."
msgstr ""
